# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.lemonmetal): the first Metal boot
# of the OnePlus 9 Pro (lemonadep).
#
# What it asks, in this order: does Metal's own discovery find our plug-in device here (metal_props,
# then metal_caps, which takes the device from MTLCreateSystemDefaultDevice() as any program does);
# does an application draw through it into a CAMetalLayer whose frames reach the panel
# (RedwoodTriangle.app, rc.jobs.triangle explains every reading of the picture); and does the same
# binary without a window draw and read its frame back (triangle_app --layer).
#
# Image: SKIP="kernel loader boot" common/build.sh lemonadep QUIET=1 SYSTEM=1 RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.lemonmetal
# (SYSTEM=1 once, for RedwoodTriangle.app in /Applications of the system image; then xl ramdisk).
# Boot-args: the profile's plus metal=1 metal_profile=1 (metal=1 lets metal_props put the two
# properties on the IOAcceleratorES service; metal_profile=1 claims the Apple2 family, without which
# SpringBoard aborts in Siri's orb). Without camtl=1 the window server keeps OpenGL ES; with it,
# CoreAnimation composites through the Metal driver too (its uber-shaders, specialised: the driver
# prints the constants of the first twelve as `specialised NAME: --fc ...`, which air2nir takes).
# Screenshot while the application runs: XL_DEVICE=lemonadep ./xl screenshot logs/triangle.png
#
# The touches walk the window server through what it composites: the lock screen until the
# swipe up at about 40 s into the job list, the home screen, the triangle application (an orange
# triangle over the lower left half of the screen, on pure blue), home again by a swipe up from
# the bottom edge, then a swipe right to the widgets beside the first home page (chronod's
# RenderBox). Screenshots at about 50, 90, 110, 130 s of the run see each of them.
/redwood/bin/vol_ls ls /Applications/RedwoodTriangle.app
/redwood/bin/metal_props on
/redwood/bin/metal_caps
/redwood/bin/metal_drv_test --sweep
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 40 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 250 wait 15
/redwood/bin/battery_test open redwoodtriangle://
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 250 wait 15
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.08 0.5 0.9 0.5 300 wait 20
/bin/ps -A
/redwood/bin/triangle_app --layer
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 120
/bin/ps -A
